      "author": "HaremCinema",
      "content": "Sierbahnn it sounds like you & I had very similar experiences watching this movie. I eagerly went into this as a keen zombie movie fan excited to watch a new zombie movie. Even though the movie itself might be OK, it disappointed me because it is not what I expected. I think I speak for all zombie zealots when I assert the old adage ‘If you promise us a zombie movie, then you owe us a zombie movie.’\r\nPersonally I think I would have enjoyed this movie much more if the filmmakers had more accurately prepared me for what I was going to experience. How about yourself, do you think that you’d enjoy this movie more on a second viewing now that you know what to expect?",
